        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586200/extras/3fd10b3fe08bae7567224e3e169b8395.avif?t=1788920237\" width=780 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having inherited the will of your late master, after years of research...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You finally succeed in creating a homunculus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is accomplished—now all that’s left is to hand it over to the government. There’s no longer any reason to live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or so you thought...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus begins your life with the homunculusーーー</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586200/extras/affef26feaafd5407d15ffa0f86debbe.avif?t=1788920237\" width=780 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A homunculus-raising simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While talking with the homunculus, you teach her about daily life and the world. Her personality changes depending on your actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take walks together, earn money through part-time jobs, and enjoy crafting through alchemy—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this is a raising game where you can experience many things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586200/extras/1ffcf7ed7e704ad50daa4f5a00fe20ad.avif?t=1788920237\" width=780 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live2D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach a cute and innocent homunculus!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl’s personality changes based on your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm, pure love story</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586200/extras/3fd10b3fe08bae7567224e3e169b8395.avif?t=1788920237\" width=780 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having inherited the will of your late master, after years of research...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You finally succeed in creating a homunculus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is accomplished—now all that’s left is to hand it over to the government. There’s no longer any reason to live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or so you thought...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus begins your life with the homunculusーーー</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586200/extras/affef26feaafd5407d15ffa0f86debbe.avif?t=1788920237\" width=780 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A homunculus-raising simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While talking with the homunculus, you teach her about daily life and the world. Her personality changes depending on your actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take walks together, earn money through part-time jobs, and enjoy crafting through alchemy—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this is a raising game where you can experience many things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586200/extras/1ffcf7ed7e704ad50daa4f5a00fe20ad.avif?t=1788920237\" width=780 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live2D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach a cute and innocent homunculus!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl’s personality changes based on your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm, pure love story</p></li></ul>",
